# Random Encounter {4}{R}{R} sorcery. "Shuffle your library, then mill four cards. Put each creature card milled this way onto the
# battlefield. They gain haste. At the beginning of the next end step, return those creatures to their owner's hand." (CR 701.17,
# 701.24, 603.7c). Bot1's library is exactly four cards, so the shuffle cannot change what is milled: two creatures and two
# lands. Both creatures enter (the lands stay in the graveyard), the 2/3 Anaba Bodyguard attacks the turn it entered (haste, CR
